


SET description, "e+ 10GeV run, trigger from MiB (plastic) + UniNa Plastic, CsITl UG11 filter, angle 0 deg. CH1: 3010 - no amp, CH2 3010 - CAEN amp 28; CH3 LYSO; CH4 MCP; CH5 Plastic 1x1x1; CH6 Trigger"
ODBSET "/Runinfo/Run description", $description

LOOP 1
   TRANSITION start
   WAIT events, 20000
   TRANSITION stop

ENDLOOP